  "description": "Four-orbital minimal-basis Slater-Koster tight-binding model for cubic halide perovskites CsBX3. Basis = B-{s, px, py, pz} only; the X-p contribution is folded into effective B-B (second-neighbour) interactions. eps_s, eps_p are the anti-bonding band centres; t's are effective second-neighbour hoppings. SOC lambda*L.S acts on the B-p manifold. Hamiltonian: Eqs. (11)-(12); dispersion functions h_i in Eq. (8). Minimal-model band gap (no SOC): Eg = eps_p - eps_s - 2*tppsigma - 4*tppi + 6*tss.",
  "source": {
    "authors": "R. Kashikar, M. Gupta, B. R. K. Nanda",
    "title": "A Generic Slater-Koster Description of the Electronic Structure of Centrosymmetric Halide Perovskites",
    "arxiv": "2101.08562",
    "version": "v1 (21 Jan 2021)",
    "parameters_from": "Table IV (four-orbital minimal model, cubic phase)",
    "units": "eV",
    "dft_reference": "PBE-GGA + Tran-Blaha mBJ"
  },
  "parameter_keys": {
    "eps_s":    "Anti-bonding band centre, s character (eps_s^A)",
    "eps_p":    "Anti-bonding band centre, p character (eps_p^A)",
    "t_ss":     "Effective second-neighbour s-s hopping (t_ss)",
    "t_sp":     "Effective second-neighbour s-p sigma hopping (t_sp)",
    "t_ppsigma":"Effective second-neighbour p-p sigma hopping (t_pp,sigma)",
    "t_pppi":   "Effective second-neighbour p-p pi hopping (t_pp,pi)",
    "lambda_SOC":"Spin-orbit coupling strength lambda on B-p"
  },
